                </common:classification>
            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The infrastructure the area used, the amount of turbined water and the greenhouse gas emissions are shared with the storage hydropower stations in the non-alpine regions of Europe. The lifetime is assumed to be 150 years for the dams and 80 years for the other material. The data describe a mix and can therefore not be used  for an individual storage hydropower station. This dataset is recalculated based on Frischknecht et al. (1996) and Bauer (2007), complemented with data from Vattenfall (2008) and Diem et al. (2008). The electricity consumption is based on BFE (2010).;
UUID: bf1b354b-15da-32d1-8100-131260a44533</common:generalComment>
