            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average installed technology. Efficiency 0.8. Annual production volume: 190GWh/a.\n\n# Included processes\nOperation of an average storage hydropower station. It includes the electricity consumption, the area transformed and occupied, the volume of the reservoir, greenhouse gas emissions, the consumption of lubricant oil and the amount of turbined water.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
